  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b1b4df5a-04fc-4172-9aa3-8c4361e51c5f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 755cafb0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -480,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 524,
        "height": 616,
        "content": "## Cal.com is the calendar. n8n only calls its API.\n\nDo NOT put Google Calendar in this workflow. Connect GCal inside Cal.com (Settings \u2192 Calendars). Slots API already subtracts busy time.\n\nPaste into Booking Config:\n- calBookingUrl = the public link\n- calUsername = the /your-name/ part\n- calEventTypeSlug = the last path segment\n- calEventTypeId = number in the event settings URL\n\nFind the values:\n1. Open app.cal.com \u2192 Event Types \u2192 click the event\n2. URL looks like app.cal.com/event-types/123456?tabName=setup\n   123456 = calEventTypeId\n3. Public link looks like cal.com/naveen/intro\n   naveen = calUsername\n   intro = calEventTypeSlug\n4. API key: app.cal.com/settings/security\n   Create key, prefix cal_ or cal_live_\n   Add it in n8n as Bearer on Cal.com Slots + Cal.com Book\n\nFlow: qualify \u2192 Cal.com Slots \u2192 offer 3 times \u2192 Cal.com Book\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
